# HCP V2 parallel agents

When building V2 across multiple subagents:

1. Create a worktree per workstream: `./scripts/v2-worktree.sh create <api|parser|graph|pal|infra|frontend>`
2. Each agent runs only its `make v2-verify-<id>` (see `AGENTS.md`).
3. Coordinator may use `make v2-verify-parallel` on one clone; do not run `test-integration` concurrently on the same host.
4. Route implementation to role subagents (`hcp-backend`, `hcp-parser`, etc.) per owned paths.

When coordinating **V5 (IDE + version control)** planning/implementation:

1. Create a v5 worktree per workstream: `./scripts/v2-worktree.sh create-v5 <hos|events|scene|fork|ide|marketplace|registry|cli>`
2. Each agent runs only its `make v5-verify-<id>` (see `AGENTS.md`).
3. Coordinator may use `make v5-verify-parallel` on one clone.
4. Keep `v2-verify-*` behavior unchanged; v5 targets must be additive and fast.
